  "title": "RPG Create+",
  "description": "Fun and simple mod pack with create and origin with levels to add some extra fun.",
  "body": "A fun mod pack with Create for the tech, Origins for some fun, and LevelZ for a challenge with the level system. I wanted a mod pack with these three elements and more of a vanilla feel to it.  Also, have the Xaero's map and minimap mod to have a simple map. Fabric Waystones for traveling to any farms and villages or anything else you want to make and set them up for. \n\nThe main component of this modpack is a vanilla plus RPG playstyle. \n\nHas a fun level system\n\n If you would like Create and a leveling system this is a fun mod pack to play.\n\nThanks for trying it out. Happy Crafting!\n\n\n\n\n",
